{{ ref: e2be4e50-af7f-4777-af0f-09b692e8afe7 }}
- **Description**: Detects structural violations in the current layout without proposing any restructure: sibling cycles over hard edges at every container level, production → test polarity leaks, capacity breaches against the 250-production-SLOC file cap and the member caps above it, and symbols exported wider than their derived scope. Findings within ±10% of a cap are classified `borderline` instead of `violation`. `strata violations --fail-on <classes>` turns selected classes into a CI gate via exit code 2.
--{ ref: e2be4e50-af7f-4777-af0f-09b692e8afe7 }--
